The source of all components is published here for transparency,
security review, and self-hosted evaluation. Publishing the source does
not itself grant redistribution, resale, or unrestricted commercial-use
rights beyond what each license below permits — see the EULA's License
Grant and Restrictions sections in particular.

"OpenPanel" and the OpenPanel logo are trademarks of OpenPanel, LLC and
are not licensed under either license below.

